Description:
This paper has a definition of an energy flexibility token for digitizing the flexibility of various prosumers allowing to be traded on the
market as an asset. In the ERC721 metadata we have changed the original mapping of the _tokenURIs with the _tokenDetails mapping  which has instead of a metadata Uniform Resource Identifier
(URI), a data structure FlexibilityMetadata:
struct FlexibilityMetadata{enum FlexibilityType
type; uint startDTime;
uint endDTime; uint timestep; string measureUnit;
address prosumer}
